msgctxt "56_Chigusa"
msgid "What were you doing in there? Come on, let's go!"
msgstr "¿Qué estabas haciendo? ¡Ven, vámonos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Kiryu"
msgid "Where to?"
msgstr "¿A dónde... voy?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Chigusa"
msgid "Well, I picked up all your stuff, so we should probably drop\\r\nby our office."
msgstr "Ya recogí todas tus cosas, así que deberíamos ir a nuestra\\r\noficina."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Kiryu"
msgid "Our, uh... office?"
msgstr "¿Nuestra oficina?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Chigusa"
msgid "Yup! I'm sure seeing it in person will jog your memory. Come\\r\non, let's go."
msgstr "¡Sí! Estoy segura de que verlo en persona te refrescará la memoria.\\r\nVen, vámonos."

